  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the Election Expert Mission to Angola 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Electoral Expert Mission (EEM) to Angola to collect factual information concerning the electoral process, with the general elections scheduled for 24 August 2022. IOM will select 2 Experts (1 Team Leader/Political/Electoral expert and 1 Legal/Human Rights Expert), who will travel to Luanda from end of July to September to meet all relevant stakeholders and produce a report. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated in any way to the work of the experts. IOM will only provide administrative, logistical and security support.</narrative>
  </description>
